  "ingredients": [
    "1 shallot, minced",
    "3 tablespoons red wine vinegar",
    "1 tablespoon white balsamic vinegar",
    "1 clove garlic, minced",
    "1 tablespoon fresh lemon juice",
    "1 tablespoon Dijon mustard",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh flat-leaf parsley",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh chives",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh cilantro",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh dill",
    "0.5 cup extra-virgin olive oil, or more to taste",
    "10 fresh asparagus spears, trimmed to 5 inches",
    "2 ears corn, husked",
    "2 zucchini, halved lengthwise",
    "2 yellow squash, halved lengthwise",
    "1 bunch green onions, tops trimmed a few inches",
    "1 large red bell pepper, cut lengthwise into 4 sections and seeded",
    "1 large red onion, sliced thickly",
    "0.25 cup olive oil, or as needed",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat and lightly oil the grate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TYYn4pLKJ3fBC8MfAMgOmDpq4MA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233437-Grilled-Vegetable-Salad-DDMFS-Step-01-0886fc8f79d54d1baeda93ed7d19ec30.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233437/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the dressing: Whisk shallot, red wine vinegar, white balsamic vinegar, garlic, lemon juice, Dijon mustard, parsley, chives, cilantro, and dill together in a large bowl. Slowly stream olive oil into the mixture while whisking vigorously until the oil is incorporated into a smooth and creamy dressing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LatTHex0NxDXJmvoiGf1Oix5DzU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233437-Grilled-Vegetable-Salad-DDMFS-Step-02-49cecf58a7434bbdbdd7f4fe28387224.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233437/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange asparagus, corn, zucchini, yellow squash, green onions, bell pepper, and red onion onto baking sheets. Brush olive oil onto all the vegetables to coat; season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/S-rcbCZX0YIa2GNVHNx2nUBMi_0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233437-Grilled-Vegetable-Salad-DDMFS-Step-03-c59834de4c994d8d9f13598c9c29ba77.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233437/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook vegetables directly on preheated grill, turning frequently, until slightly charred and just tender, about 5 minutes for green onions, 8 minutes for asparagus, zucchini, yellow squash, bell pepper, and red onion, and 10 minutes for corn. Remove vegetables to the baking sheets used for preparation and cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CoGgSDO40C5Lcuh_2o7yGSS2cN0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233437-Grilled-Vegetable-Salad-DDMFS-Step-04-0439a22ce1eb4b2aaa8cbc67de65b61e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233437/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut asparagus, green onions, zucchini, yellow squash, and red bell pepper crosswise into 1-inch pieces and put into a large bowl. Quarter red onion slices; add to bowl. Cut corn kernels from cobs; add to bowl. Let vegetables cool to room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UZyWGmfXMY-PfD51jhSgFBKIqNM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233437-Grilled-Vegetable-Salad-DDMFS-Step-05-26fc74460c45412c98006814f78a11ad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233437/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle vinaigrette over the vegetable mixture and toss to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ra-B6s8iUUQh6tRKgD_qp9-y7DA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233437-Grilled-Vegetable-Salad-DDMFS-Step-06-7fd2b8f7f0524dc19e7e6dae145eea04.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233437/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4NXKI-l8qwc-bQiUZhewEr792oM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233437-Grilled-Vegetable-Salad-DDMFS-Step-07-d10d759d594b470fba99dd0222c58fd9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233437/step_07.webp"
    }
